  "summary": "I’m a passionate backend developer with over 13 years of experience building reliable, scalable software systems.\n\nDuring my 11+ years at the University of Computer Sciences in Havana, Cuba, I developed cross-platform desktop applications using C++/Qt and RESTful APIs with Python and Django—gaining solid experience in backend development, databases, and software architecture.\n\nSince 2022, I’ve been working as a Senior Backend Developer at Monogroup, where I design APIs using FastAPI and Python, applying clean architecture, SOLID principles, and modern design patterns.\n\nMy database experience includes PostgreSQL (primary), MySQL, MongoDB, and SQLite (for testing). I manage containerized environments using Docker and build CI/CD pipelines with Git, GitHub, and GitHub Actions.\n\nI also develop cross-platform interfaces with Qt and PyQt, integrating them with Python backends.\n\nI enjoy working in collaborative, agile environments with strong development practices and I’m always looking to grow and contribute to impactful software projects.",
